                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9ea3e302-563b-3aa5-a52d-06be12b8abf3",
                        "entry_id": "3d9ed908-3bad-3c10-94b6-9bda278bb6c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "lascivious"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c304c7d-b74c-4dcf-9781-fd990990069f",
                                "sense_id": "9ea3e302-563b-3aa5-a52d-06be12b8abf3",
                                "text": "— Охо́ты нет, так я и знал! — вскрича́л тот в поры́ве неи́стовой зло́бы. — Врёте вы, дрянно́й, блудли́вый, изло́манный барчо́нок, не ве́рю, аппети́т у вас во́лчий!..[...]",
                                "translation": "\"No desire, I just knew it!\" the other cried out in a burst of frenzied spite. \"You're lying, you rotten, lascivious, pretentious little squire, I don't believe you, you've got a wolf's appetite! ..…\"",
                                "english": "\"No desire, I just knew it!\" the other cried out in a burst of frenzied spite. \"You're lying, you rotten, lascivious, pretentious little squire, I don't believe you, you've got a wolf's appetite! ..…\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "838c0256-b9d5-48cd-9608-0b78d662cf3c",
                                "sense_id": "9ea3e302-563b-3aa5-a52d-06be12b8abf3",
                                "text": "Вале́рия залива́лась зво́нким, хру́пким сме́хом. И у Людми́лы глаза́ ста́ли веселы́ и блудли́вы.",
                                "translation": "Valeria broke into a clear, fragile laugh. And Liudmilla's eyes looked gay and mischievous again.",
                                "english": "Valeria broke into a clear, fragile laugh. And Liudmilla's eyes looked gay and mischievous again."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
